> S'far as I know you needed cursed scroll of teleportation.

!!! Spoiler Alert !!!

Occasionally, in the lower levels (15 or greater), you encounter some writing
on the floor that you did not make. It sames something like "a?dk? at?kkd?".
This is a clue that there is a hidden door with a pathway that is one step
deep. Like this

         x <--- one step
|--------+------|
|...............|
         ^
 writing is here

first, find the doorway, then open it. They're locked often. Stand _in_ the
doorway, then search. You will find a step. Keep searching, it will turn into
a trap. It is usually either a trap door or a level teleport trap. 

I never bother looking for a cursed scroll of teleport, I just make sure I
have tele control and find one of these closets. Further, since I usually
find two or three, I find the level that the wizard is on, keep going up 
and entirely map all the mazes up to the castle, then teleport down again 
using another closet to the exact level that the wiz is on and then haul ass
up the levels with the amulet. This way, on the first time up, I can raid 
Vlad's tower, haul up all the $ I can find as well as the gems, and deposit 
them near a stairwell on a higher level and I can pick them up on the way out 
with the amulet.

